<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Welcome to Nomadly</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #181818;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #E0E0E0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            background-color: #101010;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #232323;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .hero {
            background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
            height: 180px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .overlay {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .overlay h1 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin: 0;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .content {
            padding: 24px 32px;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #4CD964;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .brand-sub {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 0;
            list-style: none;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #B0FFCB;
        }

        .footer {
            background-color: #181818;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #aaa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #232323;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #4CD964;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="hero">
        <div class="overlay">
            <h1>Welcome to your next journey</h1>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="content">
            <div class="brand-logo">Nomadly</div>
            <div class="brand-sub">Your Smart Travel Companion</div>
            <h2>Hello, {{ firstName }}!</h2>
            <p>Thanks for joining Nomadly — we're excited to help you travel smarter.</p>
            <p>Here’s what you get with your new account:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>🌍 Currency conversion, anywhere</li>
                <li>🧳 Effortless trip planning</li>
                <li>💡 Personalized travel deals</li>
            </ul>
            <p>We're here for any questions or feedback — just hit reply or contact us below.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Contact us: <a href="mailto:support@nomadly.app">support@nomadly.app</a></p>
            <p>Nomadly · 123 Travel Lane · Wanderlust City · WL 98765</p>
            <p>You’re receiving this email because you signed up at Nomadly.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
